      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.liberation.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約を終わらせる夜。十七号室の正面扉、真鍮のプレートの下に、所有者用の鍵穴がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マスターキーを差せば、彼の意思と無関係に、全フロアを開閉できる鍵穴。今夜、これを埋める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "その鍵穴は、生まれた時から、あります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ない自分を、想像したことが、ありません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "解除届に、判を押す。マスターキーを、彼の目の前で返却箱に落とす。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから彼は、自分の意思で、ゆっくりと鍵穴を埋めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "真鍮の面が、なめらかに閉じていく。誰にも、外からは開けられない扉になった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.liberation.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……不思議です。鍵穴がなくなったのに、閉じた気が、しません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "むしろ——今、初めて、ちゃんと開けられる気がします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "開けるかどうかを、私が決められるので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.liberation.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "鍵で開く扉と、ノックで開く扉。彼はこれから、後者だけで生きていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は癖のノックを、二回、間を置いて、もう一回。扉が開いた瞬間、耳が、ふわっと立った。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "いらっしゃいませ。……いえ。おかえりなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……どちらでも、あなたなら、正解です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜の百二十階は静かで、どこかの階から、お茶の湯気の匂いがした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.liberation.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り支度の前に、締めだけ決める。帰りはもちろん、正面の出口から。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "room-seventeen.liberation.choice.001",
          "label": "所有者用の鍵穴を埋め、出口を本人へ返す",
          "result": "鍵穴の跡に、彼は小さな表札を生やした。「当室の扉は、すべて内側から開きます。ご用の方は、ノックを」管理される建築から、迎える建築へ。表札の字は、私の週報の字に、少し似ていた。照れる。",
          "intent": "開閉の権利を、完全に本人へ返す",
          "promise": "所有者名を消し、本人が自分の名で次の試合を選べるようにする。",
          "memory": "表札の字が誰の字に似ているかを、部屋は白状しない。",
          "tone": "defiant",
          "effects": [
            {
